{"id":"n29749-5-10","stage":1,"title":"나누다 · 一起吃","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29749-5-10-1","ko":"아, 승규 씨 오랜만입니다!","zh":"啊，承奎先生，好久不见啦！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"아：喂","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"5","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승규","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎","readings":[{"term":"승규","audio":"/audio/20c7bbd00a1a5f26d499.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"씨","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오랜만입니다!","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"要和别人搭话或引起注意时先发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]}],"audio":"/audio/85d00e97c51a2191a7c1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29749-5-10-2","ko":"네, 반갑습니다. 어디 가서 커피 한잔 나누며 잠시 이야기나 할까요?","zh":"嗯，很高兴见到您。我们去哪儿喝杯咖啡，边喝边聊一会儿吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반갑습니다.","meaning":"高兴，开心，喜悦","explanation":"반갑다：高兴，开心，喜悦；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"반갑다","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70861","senseId":"1","lemma":"반갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커피","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한잔","meaning":"一杯，一盅","explanation":"한잔：一杯，一盅","readings":[{"term":"한잔","audio":"/audio/b94a4dfc6a50694d1d0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72462","senseId":"1","lemma":"한잔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나누며","meaning":"一起吃，分享","explanation":"나누다：一起吃，分享；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"5","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠시","meaning":"片刻，暂时","explanation":"잠시：片刻，暂时","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71203","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이야기나","meaning":"聊天，说话","explanation":"이야기：聊天，说话；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"2","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할까요?","meaning":"以某种方式构成行为。","explanation":"하다：以某种方式构成行为。；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"25","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"d5cacddd111bc906","term":"반갑다","zh":"高兴，开心，喜悦","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3","entryId":"70861","definition":"因见到想见的人或实现了愿望而感到欢喜愉快。","pronunciation":["반갑따"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"是一种用咖啡豆制作出来的、苦涩的深棕色饮品，其含有独特的香味及咖啡因。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b94a4dfc6a50694d","term":"한잔","zh":"一杯，一盅","audio":"/audio/b94a4dfc6a50694d1d0d.mp3","entryId":"72462","definition":"很容易就能喝一次的茶或酒。","pronunciation":["한잔"]},{"id":"8a88d2ae9895b06e","term":"나누다","zh":"一起吃，分享","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3","entryId":"29749","definition":"一同或分着吃食物。","pronunciation":["나누다"]},{"id":"6fcdfa8c124ab5cb","term":"잠시","zh":"片刻，暂时","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3","entryId":"71203","definition":"一小会儿。","pronunciation":["잠ː시"]},{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"聊天，说话","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"和别人交流的话。","pronunciation":["이야기"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"以某种方式构成行为。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"以某种方式构成行为。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/83c3f766d1b3547abab3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.32,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29749","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"5","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.6117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["啊，承奎先生，好久不见啦！","嗯，很高兴见到您。我们去哪儿喝杯咖啡，边喝边聊一会儿吧？","前辈，这段时间您过得好吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["啊，承奎先生，好久不见啦！","嗯，很高兴见到您。我们去哪儿喝杯咖啡，边喝边聊一会儿吧？","前辈，这段时间您过得好吗？"],"answer":1}]}
